Description: Windows 11 style Start menu for the Xfce panel
 Shopno Menu is an application menu plugin for the Xfce panel, modelled on
 the Windows 11 Start menu, without ads or a Recommended section.
 .
 It offers search, pinned and recently used apps, all apps by category or
 in a grid or list, user and power controls, and optional background blur
 with picom. It follows the GTK and icon theme.
